WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.090
SHINING SOUL

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.240
You know what you have to do don't you, Kai?

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:49.490
You <i>must</i> contact me as soon as you find out something about the Sacred Beasts at the Asian Tournament.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:51.720
I will.

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:03.550
Report back even for the tiniest piece of info.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:04.870
Are we clear?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:28.500
Takao sure is taking his time. We're just about to leave for the Asian Tournament too...

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.480
According to my data, the likelihood of him oversleeping is rather high.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.760
We're going to take off any minute now!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.660
I overslept! Please, wait for me!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.340
I made it in time...

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.930
You most certainly did not!

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:54.000
I was so excited last night I couldn't sleep.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.220
I knew it.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.160
You were excited?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.160
What are you, a grade schooler?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.160
Apologize for arriving late.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.540
What did you say, you jerk?!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:08.380
He's right. Kai was the first to
get here and waited all this time.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.660
Oh, I see.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.580
You were the first to get here..?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.680
Does this mean <i>you</i> were the one who was too excited and woke up early?

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.690
I admit I look forward to
fighting against the world, yes.

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.080
Rei's not here. Did he oversleep like I did?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.910
Rei said he'll be waiting for us there.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:29.680
Makes sense. China is Rei's homeland, after all.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.260
Wait! Why are <i>you</i> here, Professor?!

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:39.080
Professor-kun will participate in the Championship as the BBA team's exclusive mechanic.

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:41.780
I see. Let's keep doing our best together!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:45.600
No matter how many times you break your Beyblade, I will fix it every time!

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:51.280
Also, in preparation for the Asian Tournament,
I developed a new Shooter especially for you, Takao.

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:53.140
A new Shooter?

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:56.100
Yes. I call it Catapult Grip Shooter.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.800
We're about to take off. Get to your seat now.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.730
Alright! At last, we're going against the world!

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.280
First stop, China!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.850
Yeah!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:46.010
Together! BBA Team,
Aim For The World

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.980
We're finally in China! Where's the Stadium?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.400
There's no Battle Stadium here.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:10.860
We're in Hong Kong. From here, we'll take the plane to the mainland where the Stadium for the Asian Tournament is.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.090
Ah, is that how it is?

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:13.160
Indeed.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:17.360
The plane we need to take
won't be ready until tomorrow,

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.390
so why don't we go eat
something in the meantime?

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:21.740
Alright!

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.680
I love Chinese cuisine!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:24.880
Food! Food!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.840
I'm so hungry I'm about to faint!

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:27.520
Awesome!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.790
You never change, Takao...

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.150
W-Whoa!

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:40.030
Wow! What a view!

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:44.490
This is all splendid! This
armchair is wonderfully comfortable.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:47.890
Wow! The beds are huge too!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:48.740
Hey!

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.300
We didn't come here to play.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:56.580
Oh come on, don't be a party pooper. We're in Hong Kong, let's have some fun!

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:01.000
Yeah! It's super soft!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:06.710
He's right, Kai. We should have
fun while we can. Let's enjoy!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:11.520
We're going up against the world, and yet... You sure seem relaxed.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:17.570
We came out at the top in the Super Battle Tournament. I'm sure we're strong enough to go against the world.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.510
I really hope that's true.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.930
Please eat to your heart's content.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.580
Thanks for the food!

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.710
Everything looks delicious!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.540
So good!

00:06:45.570 --> 00:06:47.520
I'm full. My stomach is happy.

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.790
It was all really good.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.790
Everything was very delicious!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.950
Takao, do you want some more tea?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:54.960
Yeah, thanks.

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:58.850
Ack! Rei..?!

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.010
Rei!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:05.200
You were so focused on eating, that you didn't even realize I was here.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:07.040
Some teammates you are.

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:11.220
Oh, don't be like that. The food here is just so delicious we lost ourselves in it.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.030
Actually, Rei, what are you doing here?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.310
I'm friends with the owner of this place.

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:20.630
He helped me a great deal during my time in Hong Kong, so I help out when he needs.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.060
His time in Hong Kong..?

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:27.020
Rei-kun travelled to all sorts of places around the world to train his Beyblade skills.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.540
Hong Kong is one of them.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.810
Is that so?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:31.760
Now then.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:35.440
We are about to enter the Asian Tournament.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:39.480
Think of the it as a sort of qualifier for the World Championship.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:45.650
Of course if you lose here, you will not be able to take part in the World Championship's American Tournament.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.370
Let's go over the rules of this championship.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:52.880
The championship uses a tournament format. You will enter as teams of four people.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:55.810
The battles will be fought by three of those four.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:08:00.720
You will get to choose freely which three will fight each time based on the situation.

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.880
I see, I see.

00:08:02.150 --> 00:08:07.210
You will fight three against three. At the end, the team who won the most matches will win.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.930
So it's a team battle?

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:14.770
Even if I win, if the other two
lose it will count as if <i>I</i> lost too?

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:17.280
I guess you could say that, yes.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:21.730
One for all. All for one.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.000
You will fight as part of the BBA Team.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:27.940
Together in victory, together in defeat... We're in the same boat.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.950
Can't say I like this way of thinking.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:35.280
Kai-kun, we are a team.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.460
I don't want to be held back by someone else!

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.720
How dare you..?!

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.330
Everything was delicious. Thanks for the meal.

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.100
Kai!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.640
Where are you going?

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:49.490
Everybody, what should we do?
I registered you as a team of four people.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:53.840
Should we look for someone
to replace Kai-kun? Or maybe...

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:58.670
Of course we need Kai! We <i>are</i> the BBA Team after all!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.320
This is what I'm talking about!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.070
Then let us go look for him!

00:09:02.070 --> 00:09:03.230
Okay...

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.170
Takao!

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:09.170
What's wrong? Are you okay?!

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:11.240
My stomach..!

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.240
Your stomach..?!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.110
My stomach is heavy.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:20.220
You never change, Takao!

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.390
It's good to be young.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.430
He's here! I need to report to Kiki-sama.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.300
Where could he have gone?

00:09:57.300 --> 00:10:01.310
It's true that Hong Kong is not a dangerous city, but what if he got lost..?

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:03.390
Professor, let's check the map.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.100
Let's try looking in this area.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.720
Why? What's in that area?

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:17.960
Going by the map, the downtown area seems to be there. Right, Rei?

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.890
I see. Kai might have gone there.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.110
Why?

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.400
Because of his Beyblader instinct.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:31.300
Beybladers are attracted to places with other Beybladers.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.710
You should know that.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.040
Wow!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.970
Beyblades are super popular even here in Hong Kong.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:54.000
It's a sign of Beyblade's world-wide appeal!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:59.250
My Beyblader blood is burning up!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:03.920
I'm sure Kai feels the same. He can't bring himself to get away from Beyblade battles.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.890
I know he will understand.

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:07.820
You're right.

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:12.050
He might have gone this way.

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:13.330
Alright, let's go.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.610
Okay.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.870
Kiki-sama, they're the ones.

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.480
He really dared to come back.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.610
Alright, go for it.

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:22.030
Yes, Sir.

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:27.890
If you manage to defeat them... Rai Nin, I will talk to the boss to have you join us officially.

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:34.540
It's a chance for a nameless Beyblader like you to become first-class. Don't screw it up.

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:36.420
Thank you very much.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:54.220
We've gotten pretty far from our hotel. We're going to get lost ourselves...

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:56.290
As long as I'm here we won't.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.810
We also have my map.

00:11:57.810 --> 00:12:01.260
Man, I'm pooped. Let's take a break, shall we?

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:06.180
Say, Rei, why did you travel the world to fight?

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.380
To get stronger, of course.

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.750
To get stronger?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.530
I want to fight with a lot of Beybladers from different countries.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:17.830
The world is huge; and it's filled with strong opponents.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.230
Filled with strong opponents?!

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:23.220
I want to fight with these guys as soon as I can!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.180
Same here.

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:27.930
That's the spirit. I want to get even stronger too.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.900
Not just strong opponents. There are also countless Bits with Sacred Beasts out there.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:35.690
Are there really so many Sacred Beasts around?

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:40.890
Yes. Based on the ones I've seen with my own eyes, there probably exists a large number of them.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:46.250
Strong Beybladers and powerful Sacred Beasts... Fighting them is my way of life.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.770
That's why I left my homeland and kept on fighting.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:51.200
So that one day I will become the strongest of them all.

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:53.600
Wow, you're amazing, Rei!

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:56.850
You're really a Beyblader through and through!

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.940
I'm gonna do the same! I will fight against the world!

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.220
Let's do it!

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:04.970
Yes. And I will offer you my
humble help from the sidelines.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.940
And to do that...

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.400
We need to get Kai back.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:14.550
No problem. Kai is a Beyblader at heart like us, I'm sure he will understand.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:17.200
Let's do this with our teamwork! Who's with me?

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.400
Okay!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:38.320
The sun is about to set. Why don't we go back to the hotel for now? Kai might be waiting for us there.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:40.660
Sounds like a plan. Let's go back and—

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:41.580
Wait.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.200
What's wrong?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.340
Don't you hear that sound?

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:50.770
Sound..?

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:59.060
It's the sound of Beyblades spinning. And spinning very hard at that.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.850
Could one of those be Kai's?

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:01.600
Let's go.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.220
Yeah.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:06.610
Kai.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.240
The sound disappeared.

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:23.340
Let's hurry.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:31.620
It's a dead end.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.070
Oh well. Let's go back then.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.530
Huh? What the..?!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:46.730
Hey.

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:50.740
You guys are going to fight me now.

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:56.010
You're the BBA Team, right? Then fight me.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:03.460
Just a moment. We have no intention of accepting a meaningless fight.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:07.650
Alright?

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.580
Who in the world are you?!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:22.190
I'm Bruce... I will defeat you and raise my status.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:27.570
If you want to get past here, you <i>will</i> have to fight me!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:33.610
We can't agree to such an informal battle. If you want to fight us, you should enter the Championship!

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:46.940
He's using the nunchuck as
a Shooter... And what control!

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:52.990
It's not just an act.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.200
Fight me if you want to pass.

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:04.390
Very well.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.160
If you're going to go that far, I will do it.

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.010
Wait!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:16.770
Don't try to stop me, Takao.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:18.760
That's not it. Let me do this.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:25.520
I'm raring to go, I can't help it. I really want to fight.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:32.410
There's no way I can make you change your mind, is there? Fair enough. But beware, this guy is not normal.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:34.310
Don't hold back or you'll lose.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:38.320
Of course! I haven't battled in forever, I can't wait!

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:52.560
So Rei's not going to fight? Oh well, I will take a close look at the BBA Team's true ability.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.260
Here we go.

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.010
Three!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:30.240
Two!

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.190
One!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.240
Go... Shoot!

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.560
What tricky movements!

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:44.820
Not bad! You're strong, aren't you!

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:50.390
Dragoon is being pushed off!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:51.680
Amazing power!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:56.450
Don't give in, Dragoon!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.210
This is bad!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:11.350
You can't give up, Takao!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.830
Do your best until the end!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.320
Easier said than done...

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.030
Takao!

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:24.810
We're about to go up against the world! Can we afford to fail here?!

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:33.710
That's right I...

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.550
We...

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:40.020
We can't afford to lose here! Go, Dragoon!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.320
You're mine now!

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:12.040
Thanks. I enjoyed battling you

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:13.250
Yeah.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.610
It was a good fight.

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:36.000
Watch out!

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.120
Kai!

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:47.630
Kai!

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:49.840
Kai! You..!

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:55.130
Don't misunderstand. If you get injured we won't be able to compete in the Championship.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:08.810
As expected from the BBA Team. An average Beyblader is no threat to you.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:10.810
I beg for your forgiveness.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:14.670
Even when you offered me the chance of joining the Byakko Clan...

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.820
I betrayed your expectations.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:19.280
The Byakko Clan..?

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:28.270
In the end, small fry will stay small fry. I have no use for you anymore. Get out of my sight.

00:20:29.030 --> 00:20:30.040
Y-Yes, Sir.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:40.170
Small fry? But he was plenty strong..?

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:58.580
How dare a traitor like you show his face here? Have you no shame?

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:03.190
Rei, do you know this guy? Who the heck is he?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:15.620
Let's just say we're somewhat acquainted. Isn't that right, Rei-san?

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:18.170
Rei..?

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:56.970 --> 00:23:04.470
According to my analysis, the boy who showed his fighting spirit against Rei is Kiki, a Beyblader from the Byakko Gang.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:08.280
The Byakko Clan and Rei... What's the relationship between the two?

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:11.630
Takao went and stared another battle!

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:17.360
That's not all. The figure on the Bit of that boy's Beyblade-- Garman... I knew it!

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:21.370
Next time: A new Sacred Beast - The Byakko Clan.

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:23.940
They just keep showing up!
